### Variables
@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000
@adminUser = "admin"
@adminPass = ""

# ============================================================
# AUTH
# ============================================================

### Login (Session-Cookie wird automatisch gespeichert)
# @name login
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "{{adminUser}}",
  "password": "{{adminPass}}"
}

###

### Wer bin ich?
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/me

###

### Logout
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/logout

###

# ============================================================
# USERS
# ============================================================

### User anlegen (PUBLIC – kein Login erforderlich)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/users
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "firstname": "Max",
  "lastname": "Musterman",
  "email": "max.mustermann6@example.com",
  "password": "Test1234!"
}

###

### Alle User abrufen (Admin-only)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/users

###

### User paginiert abrufen (Admin-only)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/user?page=1&limit=10

###

### Einzelnen User abrufen
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/users/admin

###

### User aktualisieren
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/users/admin
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "firstname": "Julius",
  "lastname": "Pravtchev"
}

###

### User löschen (Sysadmin-only)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/users/max1234

###

# ============================================================
# STATISTICS
# ============================================================

### API Traffic Statistiken
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/statistics/traffic

###

### User Wachstum (Churn)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/statistics/churn

###

# ============================================================
# HEALTHCHECK
# ============================================================

### Healthcheck
GET {{baseUrl}}/healthcheck

###
